paragraph.content:
Reserve concomitant prescribing of Oxycodone Hydrochloride Oral Solution and benzodiazepines or other CNS depressants for use in patients for whom alternative treatment options are inadequate [see Warnings and Precautions (5.4)


                                 , Drug Interactions (7)
                              ].

text.paragraph:
Discuss the options for obtaining an opioid overdose reversal agent (e.g., prescription, over-the counter, or as part of a community-based program) [see
                                 Warnings and Precautions (5.2)
                              ].
